  "description": {
    "text": "The Italian release of the set for Pokémon's 25th anniversary. In Italy each Happy Meal held a pack of four cards from 27 August to 2 September 2021, and after trouble with that handout the cards were given out again from 17 to 23 September 2021. The 25 cards are Pikachu and the 24 first partner Pokémon of the eight regions so far, each in a standard and a confetti holo version, all with the Pokémon 25th logo."
